OL,3,GNEWSANo audit on Agilisys contract halt
OL,4,Aever took place
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo financial audit took place following
OL,7,Fthe cancellation of the #200m contract
OL,8,Fwith IT provider Agilisys in July 2025,
OL,9,Fthe States has revealed.
OL,11,FIn October 2025, Policy and Resources
OL,12,F(P&R) said a "full financial audit" of
OL,13,Fthe cost impact was carried out, but
OL,14,Fhas now said it was actually a
OL,15,F"financial review".
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
