OL,3,GNEWSANo audit on Agilisys contract halt
OL,4,Aever took place
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The scope of the financial review
OL,7,Fundertaken as part of the Transition
OL,8,FProject did not meet the criteria of an
OL,9,Faudit - in reference to the October
OL,10,F2025 Freedom of Information response,
OL,11,Fthe responders mistakenly referred to a
OL,12,F'financial audit' in error," it said.
OL,14,FIn 2025, P&R cancelled its contract
OL,15,Fwith Agilisys midway through following
OL,16,Fa damning report of its services.
